<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa offers &quot;Love Parade&quot; fare for youths.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa offers &quot;Love Parade&quot; fare for youths.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German airline Deutsche Lufthansa AG will soon turn some of its aircraft into &quot;love planes&quot; by offering special fares for those wanting to attend next month's &quot;Love Parade&quot; techno fest in Berlin.</p>
<p>&quot;It's a special offer to attract potential passengers and fill up excess capacity,&quot; Lufthansa spokeswoman Dagmar Rotter told Reuters.</p>
<p>Pasengers under 30 can buy the limited tockets for 111 marks plus tax.</p>
</text>
